01:52:48.697 [transcriber] seg[321] KEEP      start=1090.00 end=1092.00 nsp=0.2484  text='А-а-а...'
01:52:48.697 [transcriber] seg[322] KEEP      start=1093.86 end=1095.36 nsp=0.2484  text='Она вышла сайд.'
