01:52:48.697 [transcriber] seg[328] KEEP      start=1119.54 end=1120.74 nsp=0.4041  text='Не, на-ня-д-д!'
01:52:48.697 [transcriber] seg[329] KEEP      start=1124.54 end=1128.34 nsp=0.4041  text='Вы меня уже впiquишь кна с Tahut.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[330] KEEP      start=1129.34 end=1131.30 nsp=0.4041  text='Не, на-д-д!'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[331] KEEP      start=1137.10 end=1138.40 nsp=0.4041  text='Не, на-д!'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[332] KEEP      start=1142.62 end=1146.78 nsp=0.3443  text='О, ближе.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[333] KEEP [?] start=1146.78 end=1151.16 nsp=0.3443 music=1 DISPUTE  text='Вот так.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[333] KEEP      start=1146.78 end=1151.16 nsp=0.3443  text='Вот так.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[335] KEEP      start=1151.16 end=1155.36 nsp=0.3443  text='О, ближе.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[336] KEEP      start=1155.36 end=1157.68 nsp=0.3443  text='Вот так, вот так, вот так.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[337] KEEP      start=1157.68 end=1159.68 nsp=0.3443  text='Вот так, вот так.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[338] KEEP      start=1159.68 end=1162.52 nsp=0.3443  text='Да, да, ближе.'
