01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[340] KEEP      start=1165.04 end=1167.32 nsp=0.3443  text='О, да.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[341] KEEP      start=1167.32 end=1171.22 nsp=0.3443  text='О, ничего не знаю.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[342] KEEP      start=1171.22 end=1175.08 nsp=0.2294  text='О, дадам!'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[343] KEEP      start=1188.34 end=1191.34 nsp=0.2294  text='О, дадам!'
