01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[353] KEEP      start=1306.00 end=1316.00 nsp=0.3018  text='Убожья!'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[355] KEEP [?] start=1316.00 end=1319.24 nsp=0.5356 music=1 DISPUTE  text='Саша, за кончей меня.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[355] KEEP      start=1316.00 end=1319.24 nsp=0.5356  text='Саша, за кончей меня.'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[357] KEEP      start=1319.24 end=1321.26 nsp=0.5356  text='Ты мой겠어요?'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[358] KEEP      start=1321.26 end=1323.80 nsp=0.5356  text='Даже с такойочи – отдал!'
01:52:48.698 [transcriber] seg[359] KEEP      start=1323.80 end=1327.44 nsp=0.5356  text='Motor уже с horsepower за...'
